PREREQUISITES:
Networking - You need routes to your destination and determine if that is persistent for your environment
DNS - You need name resolution working from Intune AzureAD Joined device
Fileshares created and accessible in file explorer from the host or Azure Files 

USE THIS LINK TO GENERATE YOUR PS1 SCRIPT
https://intunedrivemapping.azurewebsites.net/DriveMapping

DON'T MAKE UP YOUR OWN FILE NAME
DriveMapping.ps1 is specific here

